GIVETH A `Penalty provided`
`12 months and a fine` MEANS
    `Penalty provided` WITH `imprisonment up to, in months` IS JUST 12, fine IS `a fine with no maximum stated in the Law`
GIVETH A `Penalty provided`
`3 months and a level 3 fine` MEANS
    `Penalty provided` WITH `imprisonment up to, in months` IS JUST 3, fine IS `a fine of a level on the standard scale` 3

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
      expected IS A LIST OF a
      actual IS A LIST OF a
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the same items` expected actual MEANS
        count expected EQUALS count actual
    AND all (GIVEN x YIELD elem x actual) expected

