`the facts of a Jersey body for Article 22` MEANS
    `Facts for the excepted foreign charity test` WITH `established under` IS `the law of Jersey`, `entitled under that law to refer to itself there as a charity` IS FALSE, `managed wholly or mainly from that jurisdiction` IS FALSE, `specified in an Order under Article 22(4)` IS FALSE

