§§ `D1: an unregistered Jersey company calls itself a charity -- the strict offence of Article 21(3)`

-- No knowledge and no intent: only Article 21(3) is contravened; the penalty is a fine of level 3 (Article 21(10)).
#ASSERT (`Int (d) the offence and the penalty for the act` fleet (YMD 2026 10 2) (`Offence case` WITH act IS `the company calls itself a charity`, officer IS NOTHING))'s `an offence is made out`
#ASSERT (`Int (d) the offence and the penalty for the act` fleet (YMD 2026 10 2) (`Offence case` WITH act IS `the company calls itself a charity`, officer IS NOTHING))'s penalties EQUALS LIST `a level 3 fine and no imprisonment`
#ASSERT (`Int (d) the offence and the penalty for the act` fleet (YMD 2026 10 2) (`Offence case` WITH act IS `the company calls itself a charity`, officer IS NOTHING))'s `every penalty is within the cap of Schedule 2 paragraph 4(3)(f)`
#ASSERT NOT (`Int (d) the offence and the penalty for the act` fleet (YMD 2026 10 2) (`Offence case` WITH act IS `the company calls itself a charity`, officer IS NOTHING))'s `the officer is also guilty under Article 37(1)`

§§ `D2: the director calls it a charity, knowing, to get a gift -- Articles 21(3)(b) and 21(4) -- and the director's connivance carries the body's penalty to the director (Article 37(1))`

-- The entity caused or permitted the statement: 21(3)(b) (strict, level 3); the director knows the entity is a Jersey entity and not a registered charity and intends to induce a gift of property: 21(4) (24 months and a fine).
-- F7.4 (favoured): both offences are made out. The body's own offence is 21(3) only (the statement was not made by the entity itself); the director, who connived, is also guilty of THAT offence: level 3.
GIVETH AN `Offence case`
`the offence case of the director and the company` MEANS
    `Offence case` WITH act IS `the director calls the company a charity knowing it is not`, officer IS JUST (`Int fx an officer who connived, of` `a body corporate` `a director of the body corporate`)

#ASSERT `the same items` (LIST `a level 3 fine and no imprisonment`, `24 months and a fine`) ((`Int (d) the offence and the penalty for the act` fleet (YMD 2026 10 2) `the offence case of the director and the company`)'s penalties)
#ASSERT (`Int (d) the offence and the penalty for the act` fleet (YMD 2026 10 2) `the offence case of the director and the company`)'s `the officer is also guilty under Article 37(1)`
#ASSERT (`Int (d) the offence and the penalty for the act` fleet (YMD 2026 10 2) `the offence case of the director and the company`)'s `the penalties of the officer` EQUALS LIST `a level 3 fine and no imprisonment`
#ASSERT (`Int (d) the offence and the penalty for the act` fleet (YMD 2026 10 2) `the offence case of the director and the company`)'s `every penalty is within the cap of Schedule 2 paragraph 4(3)(f)`

