#ASSERT NOT (`Int (d) the offence and the penalty for the act` fleet (YMD 2026 10 2) `the offence case of an unincorporated association`)'s `the officer is also guilty under Article 37(1)`
#ASSERT (`Int (d) the offence and the penalty for the act` fleet (YMD 2026 10 2) `the offence case of an unincorporated association`)'s `the penalties of the officer` EQUALS EMPTY

§§ `D4: a governor acts after reporting a reportable matter, without permission -- Article 19(10) -- and without reasonable excuse -- Article 19(11)`

GIVETH A `Position of a governor under Article 19(2)`
`the position of a governor who reported on 1 March 2026` MEANS
    `Position of a governor under Article 19(2)` WITH
        `the matter arose on` IS YMD 2026 2 20
        `the governor became aware of the matter on` IS YMD 2026 2 22
        `reported to the entity or charity on` IS JUST (YMD 2026 3 1)
        `reported to the Commissioner on` IS JUST (YMD 2026 3 1)
        `the reports were made promptly` IS TRUE
        `a prompt time has run out` IS TRUE

GIVETH AN `Act alleged in the case`
`the governor acts a month after reporting` MEANS
    `acting as a governor after reporting a reportable matter` WITH
        `the entity is a registered charity` IS TRUE
        position IS `the position of a governor who reported on 1 March 2026`
        permissions IS EMPTY
        `the act is done in accordance with any condition on the permission` IS FALSE
        `the person has a reasonable excuse` IS FALSE

-- Reported on 1 March 2026 and acted on 1 April 2026, with no permission: the ban of 19(10) applies. No reasonable excuse: the offence is made out, with 12 months and a fine.
#ASSERT (`Int (d) the offence and the penalty for the act` fleet (YMD 2026 4 1) (`Offence case` WITH act IS `the governor acts a month after reporting`, officer IS NOTHING))'s `an offence is made out`
#ASSERT (`Int (d) the offence and the penalty for the act` fleet (YMD 2026 4 1) (`Offence case` WITH act IS `the governor acts a month after reporting`, officer IS NOTHING))'s penalties EQUALS LIST `12 months and a fine`
-- Before the report (28 February 2026) there is no ban.
#ASSERT NOT (`Int (d) the offence and the penalty for the act` fleet (YMD 2026 2 28) (`Offence case` WITH act IS `the governor acts a month after reporting`, officer IS NOTHING))'s `an offence is made out`
-- With a reasonable excuse, Article 19(11) does not bite.
GIVETH AN `Act alleged in the case`
`the governor acts a month after reporting, with a reasonable excuse` MEANS
    `acting as a governor after reporting a reportable matter` WITH
        `the entity is a registered charity` IS TRUE
        position IS `the position of a governor who reported on 1 March 2026`
        permissions IS EMPTY
        `the act is done in accordance with any condition on the permission` IS FALSE
        `the person has a reasonable excuse` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Int (d) the offence and the penalty for the act` fleet (YMD 2026 4 1) (`Offence case` WITH act IS `the governor acts a month after reporting, with a reasonable excuse`, officer IS NOTHING))'s `an offence is made out`

