#ASSERT NOT (`Int (d) the offence and the penalty for the act` fleet (YMD 2026 10 2) (`Offence case` WITH act IS (`contravening a disqualification order` WITH contravenes IS FALSE), officer IS NOTHING))'s `an offence is made out`
