#ASSERT (`Int (d) the offence and the penalty for the act` fleet (YMD 2026 10 2) (`Offence case` WITH act IS `the person withholds what the Commissioner required`, officer IS NOTHING))'s penalties EQUALS LIST `3 months and a level 3 fine`
