#ASSERT NOT `Art 21(2) the statement contravenes paragraph (2)` `d9 the company as an entity` FALSE `d9 sA2`
#ASSERT `Art 21(1)(b) the entity contravenes sub-paragraph (b)` `d9 the company as an entity` FALSE `d9 sA2`
#ASSERT NOT `Art 21(1)(a) the entity contravenes sub-paragraph (a)` `d9 the company as an entity` FALSE `d9 sA2`
-- (1, control) The same words and intent against a donor, another person: 21(2) is contravened, 24 months and a fine.
#ASSERT `Art 21(2) the statement contravenes paragraph (2)` `d9 the company as an entity` FALSE `d9 sA3`
#ASSERT (`Int (d) the offence and the penalty for the act` fleet (YMD 2026 10 2) (`d9 the case of` `d9 sA3`))'s penalties EQUALS LIST `24 months and a fine`
-- (2) The entity itself (Article 21(7)).
#ASSERT `the person making the statement is the entity` `d9 sB`
#ASSERT `Art 21(2) the statement contravenes paragraph (2)` `d9 the company as an entity` FALSE `d9 sB`
#ASSERT `the same items` (LIST `a level 3 fine and no imprisonment`, `24 months and a fine`) ((`Int (d) the offence and the penalty for the act` fleet (YMD 2026 10 2) (`d9 the case of` `d9 sB`))'s penalties)
#ASSERT (`Int (d) the offence and the penalty for the act` fleet (YMD 2026 10 2) `d9 the case of the connivance of a director in sB`)'s `the officer is also guilty under Article 37(1)`
#ASSERT `the same items` (LIST `a level 3 fine and no imprisonment`, `24 months and a fine`) ((`Int (d) the offence and the penalty for the act` fleet (YMD 2026 10 2) `d9 the case of the connivance of a director in sB`)'s `the penalties of the officer`)
-- (3) Cause or permit, article 21(1)(b), with a third-party maker and with the entity as the maker.
#ASSERT `Art 21(1)(b) the entity contravenes sub-paragraph (b)` `d9 the company as an entity` FALSE `d9 sC1`
