#ASSERT (`Int (d) the offence and the penalty for the act` fleet (YMD 2026 10 2) (`d9 the case of` `d9 sC1`))'s penalties EQUALS LIST `a level 3 fine and no imprisonment`
#ASSERT `Art 21(1)(a) the entity contravenes sub-paragraph (a)` `d9 the company as an entity` FALSE `d9 sC2`
#ASSERT NOT `Art 21(1)(b) the entity contravenes sub-paragraph (b)` `d9 the company as an entity` FALSE `d9 sC2`
#ASSERT (`Int (d) the offence and the penalty for the act` fleet (YMD 2026 10 2) (`d9 the case of` `d9 sC2`))'s penalties EQUALS LIST `a level 3 fine and no imprisonment`
#ASSERT NOT (`Int (d) the offence and the penalty for the act` fleet (YMD 2026 10 2) (`d9 the case of` `d9 sC3`))'s `an offence is made out`
